# Trying frostroot on frostroot's own checkout leaves a user's recipe here:
# the recipe, its lock, the keys and certificates it names, capture's report
# and the vendored pools. None of them belong to this repository, and
# /vendor/ in particular is hundreds of megabytes of .deb files.
/vendor/
/frostroot.toml
/frostroot.lock
/frostroot-capture.md
/keys/
/certs/
